<http://kg.sports-injuries.org/paper/P12> a ont:Paper ;
    ont:abstractText "Hamstring strain injury (HSI) may result in considerable impairment, activity limitation, and participation restriction, including time lost from competitive sports. This CPG includes sports-related overloading and overstretching injuries to myofascial or musculotendinous structures in any combination of the 3 hamstring muscles (the semitendinosus, semimembranosus, and biceps femoris). J Orthop Sports Phys Ther 2022;52(3):CPG1–CPG44. doi:10.2519/jospt.2022.0301"^^xsd:string ;
    ont:doi "10.2519/jospt.2022.0301"^^xsd:string ;
